00:04:22.020 --> 00:04:24.990
But it nonetheless struck a
nerve with the Twitter-verse

00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:26.100
because if there's one place

00:04:26.100 --> 00:04:28.680
the internet loves to
aim its collective ire,

00:04:28.680 --> 00:04:30.660
it's at the Disney extended universe's

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:33.000
